---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import {CHECKED,SOURCES,RECORDS,TOPICS,FAQ} from '../data/tax-guide.mjs';
import '../styles/tax-guide.css';
import '../styles/tax-workspace.css';
---
<Base title="Employee tax-return checklist Australia" description="Organise work expenses, check your records and prepare to lodge your Australian employee tax return yourself in myTax. Free, with no sign-up.">
<div class="tax-page">
<header class="hl-wrap tax-simple-head"><div class="hl-breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Tax checklist</div><p class="tax-kicker">FREE EMPLOYEE TAX CHECKLIST</p><h1>Tax time.<br/>One step at a time.</h1><p>Get your records together, organise work expenses and leave with a checklist for myTax.</p><ul class="tax-trust-list" aria-label="Using this tool"><li>Free from start to finish</li><li>No account needed</li><li>No TFN or bank login</li></ul><p class="tax-service-note">You prepare here. You lodge with the ATO through myTax.</p></header>
<section class="hl-wrap tax-workspace" id="tax-companion" aria-label="Tax return companion">
<aside class="tax-sidebar" aria-label="Your progress"><p class="tax-sidebar-title">Your preparation</p><ol id="tax-progress"><li aria-current="step"><span>1</span><div><strong>Your situation</strong><small>Check this tool fits</small></div></li><li><span>2</span><div><strong>Work expenses</strong><small>Add what you paid</small></div></li><li><span>3</span><div><strong>Your checklist</strong><small>Review and download</small></div></li></ol><div class="tax-sidebar-note"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 3h9l4 4v14H6z"/><path d="M14 3v5h5M9 12h7M9 16h5"/></svg><p>A checklist you can keep.<small>Download it free, or save a draft in this browser.</small></p></div><button type="button" class="tax-text-button" id="tax-reset">Start over</button></aside>
<div class="tax-main"><div class="tax-step-meta"><span id="tax-step-count">STEP 1 OF 3</span><span id="tax-step-name">Your situation</span></div><div class="tax-track"><div id="tax-track-fill"></div></div>
<form id="tax-form" novalidate>
<section data-tax-step="0"><h2 tabindex="-1">Let’s start with you.</h2><p class="tax-intro-note">Four quick questions to check whether this employee checklist suits your situation.</p><details class="tax-prep-note"><summary>What should I have handy?</summary><p>Your income statements, bank interest details and any work-expense records. You do not need to upload documents or enter your income here.</p></details>
<div class="tax-basics-grid">
<div><label class="tax-label" for="tax-year">Income year</label><select id="tax-year" name="year" required><option value="">Choose year</option><option value="2025-26">2025–26 · 1 Jul 2025 – 30 Jun 2026</option><option value="2024-25">2024–25 · 1 Jul 2024 – 30 Jun 2025</option><option value="future">2026–27 · still in progress</option><option value="other">An earlier year</option></select></div>
<div><label class="tax-label" for="tax-job">Your work</label><select id="tax-job" name="job" required><option value="">Choose work</option><option value="retail">Retail</option><option value="hospitality">Café, restaurant or hospitality</option><option value="other">Another employee role</option></select></div>
<div><label class="tax-label" for="tax-residency">Tax residency</label><select id="tax-residency" name="residency" required aria-describedby="tax-residency-help"><option value="">Choose status</option><option value="resident">Australian tax resident all year, 18+</option><option value="other">Part-year, foreign, working holiday or under 18</option><option value="unsure">I’m not sure</option></select><small id="tax-residency-help">Different from visa status. <a href={SOURCES.residency.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Check with ATO ↗</a></small></div>
<div><label class="tax-label" for="tax-income">What’s in your return?</label><select id="tax-income" name="income" required aria-describedby="tax-income-help"><option value="">Choose income types</option><option value="simple">Australian wages & bank interest only</option><option value="complex">Other income or investments</option><option value="unsure">I’m not sure</option></select><small id="tax-income-help">Choose “Other” for business/ABN income, rent, shares, crypto, foreign income or capital gains.</small></div>
</div><div id="tax-coverage" class="tax-notice" hidden role="status"></div><p id="tax-outside-links" hidden><a href={SOURCES.lodge.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ATO self-lodgment guidance ↗</a> · <a href={SOURCES.help.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ATO help ↗</a></p></section>
<section data-tax-step="1" hidden><h2 tabindex="-1">One expense at a time.</h2><p class="tax-intro-note">Use a receipt or record to fill in the details. No expenses? You can go straight to your checklist.</p><p class="tax-step-reassurance">This organises costs for you to check. It does not decide what you can claim.</p>
<section class="tax-expense-tool" aria-label="Expense organiser"><div class="tax-entry-grid"><div><label for="expense-category">Expense topic</label><select id="expense-category">{TOPICS.map(t=><option value={t.id}>{t.title}</option>)}</select></div><div><label for="expense-date">Date paid</label><input id="expense-date" type="date"/></div><div class="tax-entry-wide"><label for="expense-description">Short description <span>(optional)</span></label><input id="expense-description" type="text" maxlength="100" placeholder="e.g. work phone bill"/></div><div><label for="expense-paid">Total cost (AUD)</label><input id="expense-paid" type="number" min="0.01" max="1000000" step="0.01" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="0.00"/></div><div><label for="expense-work">How much was for work? (%)</label><input id="expense-work" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.01" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="e.g. 40" aria-describedby="expense-work-help"/><small id="expense-work-help">For example, 40% means 4 out of every 10 uses were for work. Use records to support your split.</small></div><div class="tax-entry-wide"><label for="expense-reimbursed">How much did your employer pay back? (AUD)</label><input id="expense-reimbursed" type="number" min="0" max="1000000" step="0.01" inputmode="decimal" value="0"/><small>Enter 0 if none. Include only money paid back for the work part of this expense.</small></div></div><p id="expense-error" role="alert"></p><button id="expense-add" type="button" class="hl-button">Add expense +</button><div class="tax-expense-total"><span>Work expenses to check</span><strong id="expense-total">$0.00</strong><small>This is not an approved deduction or a refund estimate.</small></div><div id="expense-list" aria-live="polite"></div><details class="tax-arithmetic"><summary>How this total works</summary><p>Cost × your work-use percentage − reimbursement for that work use. Each entry is rounded to cents. For example, a hypothetical $100 bill × 40% work use − $10 reimbursement leaves $30 of cost to review.</p><p>We have not assessed whether a cost is deductible, when it can be claimed, or whether depreciation or other special rules apply. Some recorded expenses may have no deduction. Do not enter this combined total directly into myTax.</p></details></section>
<details class="tax-topic-browser"><summary>Explore expense rules & topics</summary><p id="tax-job-source"></p><div class="tax-topics">{TOPICS.map(t=><article class="tax-topic"><label><input type="checkbox" name="topics" value={t.id}/><strong>{t.title}</strong></label><details><summary>Rules & examples</summary><p>{t.summary}</p><p>{t.explanation}</p><h3>What to gather</h3><p>{t.records}</p><div class="tax-example"><p>{t.example}</p></div><a href={SOURCES[t.source].url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{SOURCES[t.source].title} ↗</a></details></article>)}</div></details></section>
<section data-tax-step="2" hidden><h2 tabindex="-1">Your checklist, ready to review.</h2><p class="tax-intro-note">Tick off your records, keep a copy, then use the official myTax service when you’re ready.</p><pre id="tax-print-content" class="tax-print-only"></pre>
<div class="tax-summary"><h3 id="tax-summary-year"></h3><p id="tax-summary-work"></p><p id="tax-record-count"></p><div id="tax-summary-expenses" hidden><span>Work expenses to check</span><strong id="tax-summary-total"></strong><small>Not an approved deduction. Check each item before using it in myTax.</small></div></div>
<h3>Check your records</h3><p class="tax-note">Tick what you’ve reviewed. Your download keeps unfinished items.</p><div class="tax-records">{RECORDS.map(r=><div class="tax-record"><label><input type="checkbox" name="records" value={r.id}/><strong>{r.title}</strong></label><details><summary>What to check</summary><p>{r.detail}</p><a href={SOURCES[r.source].url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ATO guidance ↗</a></details></div>)}</div>
<div class="tax-result-actions"><button type="button" class="hl-button" id="tax-download">Save checklist ↓</button><button type="button" class="tax-secondary" id="tax-csv" hidden>Expenses CSV ↓</button><button type="button" class="tax-secondary" id="tax-print">Print / PDF</button></div>
<p class="tax-note">Download your checklist or choose “Save on this device” below before leaving. Changes are not saved automatically.</p>
<details class="tax-text-export"><summary>View checklist as text</summary><pre id="tax-checklist-text"></pre></details><p id="tax-download-status" role="status"></p>
<details class="tax-topic-browser"><summary>How to complete your return in myTax</summary><ol class="tax-lodge-steps"><li><strong>Open the official service.</strong> Sign in to myGov, select ATO online services and the correct return year. Never enter your login details here.</li><li><strong>Check and personalise.</strong> Review personal details and select all applicable income and deduction sections. Check every employer’s finalised statement and interest; add missing income without duplicating pre-filled amounts.</li><li><strong>Work through the return.</strong> Check the ATO help beside each field and the selected year’s rules. Enter supported amounts; review other relevant sections, including offsets, Medicare, private health insurance and study loans.</li><li><strong>Review, then lodge yourself.</strong> Resolve missing information, review the estimate and read the declaration. Submit in myTax only when satisfied. Keep the receipt and supporting records. An estimate is not the final notice of assessment.</li></ol><p class="tax-note">Follow the current ATO screens. Nothing on Howloop submits a return.</p><a href={SOURCES.simulator.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Try the ATO practice simulator ↗</a></details>
<div class="tax-official-links"><a href="https://my.gov.au/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open official myGov ↗</a></div></section>
<p id="tax-error" role="alert"></p><div class="tax-controls"><button type="button" id="tax-back" class="tax-secondary" hidden>← Back</button><button type="submit" id="tax-next" class="hl-button">Continue →</button></div>
</form><details class="tax-draft"><summary>Save & come back later</summary><p>Keep a draft in this browser only. It includes your answers, added expenses and any expense you are still typing. Anyone using this browser profile can open it.</p><div class="tax-result-actions"><button type="button" class="tax-secondary" id="tax-save-device">Save on this device</button><button type="button" class="tax-secondary" id="tax-restore-device" hidden>Restore saved checklist</button><button type="button" class="tax-secondary" id="tax-clear-device" hidden>Delete saved checklist</button></div><p id="tax-storage-status" role="status">Nothing is saved automatically.</p></details><noscript><p>Enable JavaScript to build a checklist, or use the ATO links below.</p></noscript></div></section>
<div class="hl-wrap tax-help"><div class="tax-source-note"><span class="tax-source-mark" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><div><strong>Built from official ATO guidance</strong><p>General sources checked {CHECKED}. Howloop is an independent educational tool.</p><a href="#tax-sources">View sources and how this works</a></div></div><p class="tax-scope-bottom">General education and expense organisation. Not a registered tax agent or ATO service. Does not approve deductions, calculate refunds or lodge returns.</p>
<details class="hl-details"><summary>Help & common questions</summary><div class="tax-faq">{FAQ.map(f=><details><summary>{f.question}</summary><p>{f.answer}</p><a href={SOURCES[f.source].url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{SOURCES[f.source].title} ↗</a></details>)}</div></details>
<details class="hl-details tax-source-details" id="tax-sources"><summary>ATO sources & how this guide works</summary><p>General sources checked {CHECKED}. Individually rechecked sources show their later review date below. This guide uses pre-written education, not a year-specific tax calculation. The year selection labels your checklist and validates expense dates. Any optional AI explanations are labelled separately.</p><div>{Object.values(SOURCES).map(s=><p><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{s.title} ↗</a>{'checkedAt' in s&&<small>Source checked {s.checkedAt}</small>}</p>)}</div><p><a href="mailto:hello@howloop.how">hello@howloop.how</a> · <a href="/editorial-policy">Editorial policy</a></p></details></div>
<section class="hl-wrap tax-ai" id="tax-ai" hidden><span class="hl-eyebrow">OPTIONAL · AI EXPLANATIONS</span><h2>A term still unclear?</h2><p>Ask a general question about one of the topics above. AI explanations can be wrong; check the linked ATO source. This assistant cannot decide your entitlement, calculate a claim or complete a return.</p><p>Enabling this panel loads Cloudflare’s verification service. Sending a question shares it with OpenAI; your checklist is not included.</p><button type="button" class="tax-secondary" id="tax-ai-enable">Enable AI explanations</button><div id="tax-ai-panel" hidden><form id="tax-ai-form"><label for="tax-ai-topic">Topic</label><select id="tax-ai-topic">{TOPICS.map(t=><option value={t.id}>{t.title}</option>)}</select><label for="tax-question">Your general question</label><textarea id="tax-question" maxlength="600" rows="3" placeholder="Why is a normal work dress code different from a uniform?" required></textarea><label class="tax-consent"><input type="checkbox" id="tax-ai-consent" required/><span>I agree to send this question and selected topic to OpenAI through Howloop. I will not include names, TFNs, account details, documents or personal financial figures. <a href="/privacy">Privacy details</a></span></label><div id="tax-turnstile"></div><button class="hl-button" type="submit">Explain this →</button></form><p id="tax-ai-status" role="status"></p><div id="tax-ai-answer" class="tax-notice" hidden></div></div></section>
</div>
</Base>
<script>import '../scripts/tax-guide';</script>
